{
  "vcon": "0.4.0",
  "uuid": "cc096aa6-791e-8aa8-8b1d-cb39f0c14db8",
  "created_at": "2026-01-08T12:26:49-05:00",
  "subject": "Inbound call, City Clerk",
  "parties": [
    {
      "name": "Sal Ricci",
      "role": "resident",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    },
    {
      "name": "Owen Haskell",
      "role": "clerk",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    }
  ],
  "dialog": [
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-08T12:23:23-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "City Clerk's office, this is Owen. How can I help you?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-08T12:23:28-05:00",
      "duration": 10,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Good afternoon. My name is Sal Ricci. I need to obtain a marriage license, and I would like to know exactly what I must bring with me."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-08T12:23:38-05:00",
      "duration": 9,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay, sure. Marriage license. Um, let me make sure I give you the whole list. Are both of you going to come in together?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-08T12:23:47-05:00",
      "duration": 8,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yes. Both of us will come in person. I do not want to arrive and be told that something is missing."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-08T12:23:55-05:00",
      "duration": 14,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "That's smart. So, generally, each of you brings a photo ID, something like a driver's license or a passport. And you'll want to know your full legal names, your dates of birth, and your places of birth."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-08T12:24:09-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Places of birth. Is the city enough, or do you need the country also?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-08T12:24:15-05:00",
      "duration": 11,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "The city and the state or country, so, the full place. And also your parents' names, if you can, um, the names they had at birth. That's usually on the form."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-08T12:24:26-05:00",
      "duration": 8,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "The maiden name of the mother. Yes. I understand. And if one of us was married before, is there a document required?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-08T12:24:34-05:00",
      "duration": 15,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yes, if either of you has been married before, you'll need to know the date and how that marriage ended. Divorce, or, you know, a death. Some people bring a copy of the paperwork just to be safe. That's a good idea."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-08T12:24:49-05:00",
      "duration": 8,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "I see. I will bring the divorce papers. Now, what is the fee? I would like to bring the correct amount."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-08T12:24:57-05:00",
      "duration": 12,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Right. So, I don't have the exact number in front of me right now, and I don't want you bringing the wrong amount. Let me, um, hold on one second and check."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-08T12:25:09-05:00",
      "duration": 2,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yes, I can wait."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-08T12:25:11-05:00",
      "duration": 22,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "[pause] Okay, I'm back. The fee is set by the city and it's posted on our page for marriage licenses. I can't read you the figure from here, but if you call back, or stop by the counter, the clerk on the front desk can tell you exactly. And you'd ask them what forms of payment we take at the same time."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-08T12:25:33-05:00",
      "duration": 8,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "That is not very precise. But I understand. I will ask at the counter. Are you open the whole day?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-08T12:25:41-05:00",
      "duration": 12,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "We're open regular business hours today, so you can come this afternoon if you like. You don't need an appointment, but it can be busy around lunchtime, so a little later is quieter."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-08T12:25:53-05:00",
      "duration": 7,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Good. One moment, please. My oven is preheating for a tray of cookies, and I must check the timer."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-08T12:26:00-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Oh, sure, no problem. Take your time."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-08T12:26:03-05:00",
      "duration": 13,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "I am back. It is fine. So, to repeat: photo ID for both, full names, birth dates and places, parents' names including the mother's maiden name, and divorce papers where applicable. Is this correct?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-08T12:26:16-05:00",
      "duration": 11,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "That's right. That's everything I'd tell you. And, um, one more thing, the license has a time limit once it's issued, so don't get it too far ahead of your ceremony."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-08T12:26:27-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "How long is the limit?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-08T12:26:30-05:00",
      "duration": 8,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "I don't have the exact number of days. The front desk will tell you that too, when you ask about the fee."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-08T12:26:38-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Very well. I will ask both questions at the counter. Thank you for your help."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-08T12:26:44-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "You're welcome, Mr. Ricci. Have a good afternoon."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-08T12:26:48-05:00",
      "duration": 1,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Goodbye."
    }
  ],
